claim seen;
evidence a from "grant"; renewable a window 1;
decisions trust limit 2; decisions other limit 2; journal window 1;
event initialize; event cycle; event probe; event denied;
state revoked = 0;
on initialize renew a;
on initialize reveal a supports seen;
on initialize commit trust because enough permitted by a;
on initialize withdraw a because a;
on cycle renew a;
on cycle reveal a supports seen;
on cycle withdraw a because a;
on probe when permission_withdrawn(trust) set revoked = 1;
on denied commit other because enough permitted by a;
